    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Einyang'ua Yeremia enkurma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.1+2CH.25.2+2CH.25.3+2CH.25.4+2CH.25.5+2CH.25.6+2CH.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 25.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ororei oewuo enetii Yeremia eing'uaa Olaitoriani to lari le tomon le Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda, laa ninye apa olari le tomon o isiet le nkitoria e Nebukadresa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa ina kata nemanita enjore o laiguanani le Babilon Yerusalem, ore Yeremia oloiboni le Nkai neikenoro apa to lgoriet le rripore otii enkaji enkitoo o laiguanani le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etipika apa Yuda Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda ninye korokoroni, ejo, “Kainyoo iyie pee imbonisho nijo, ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani: Ng'ura kaishooyo nanu ena anasa apik nkaik o laiguanani le Babilon, naa keya ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meimisho tukul Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda too nkaik oo Lkaldayo kake kepiki enkaina o laiguanani le Babilon, naa keiro ninye tenebo ninye eing'ura too nkomomi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa keya ninye Sedekia Babilon, nebik ninye teine ometaba anaa namutan nanu ninye, Olaitoriani ojo. Ore hoo niaarare iyie Ilkaldayo mimirisho iyie.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Yeremia, “Eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enatii nanu ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kelotu Hanamel olayioni le Shalom olenkapu lino enitii nejo, ‘Inyiang'u enkurma ai natii Anatot, amu iyie eishiaakino tenikordu ainyiang'u.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Hanamel olenkapu lai enatii tiatua olgoriet le rripore, terisioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani, naajoki nanu, ‘Inyiang'u enkurma ai natii Anatot tiatua enkop e Benchamen, amu iyie eishiaakino te niya ainyiang'u; inyiang'aki iyie kewan.’ Nayiolou taa nchere ororei lo Laitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainyiang'u nanu ina kurma natii Anatot te Hanamel olayioni lo lenkapu lai, naipimoki ninye mpisai naaji shekeli tomon oopishana enkosholai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naiger te nkarna ai teina palai enkurma, nemisir neyau ilchakenini, neipim mpisai to rratili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki nanu aitayu ina palai namishira e nkinyiang'unoto, natii olning'o o ndung'eta o ina boitati enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "entashati:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "empalai natashakini enkae aaitayu enanyaanyukie",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naisho nanu ina palai e nkinyiang'unoto Barak olayioni le Neria olayioni le Mahasia, te dukuya Hanamel olenkapu lai, te dukuya ilchakenini ootimishira ina palai e nkinyang'unoto, o te dukuya Ilyahudi pooki apa ootonita to lgoriet le rripore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitanap nanu Barak te dukuya ninche olchakenini ajoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Iwa kuna pala pokira, ena namishira e nkinyang'unoto o ena tashati enye nememishira, nipik ninche atua emoti oo nkulukuok, pee etum aatobik te nkata naado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel keitokini aainyiang'u nkajijik o nkurman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkomono e Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore aidipa aishoo ina palai e nkinyang'unoto Barak olayioni le Neria, naomon nanu Olaitoriani ajo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Olaitoriani Enkai! Iyie oitobira shumata o enkop te ngolon ino kitok o te nkaina ino naitoriori! Meetae entoki nagol te iyie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oitoduaya enyorrata nauno too nkalifuni, kake intalaku entorroni oo loo menye too nkera enye te siadi ninche, Iyie Enkai olmagilani oji enkarna enye Olaitoriani loo lororani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitok too nkiguanat naa magilani te yasata; obolo nkonyek enyena too nkoitoi pooki oo ltung'ana, nilaaki pooki tung'ani te risioroto oo nkoitoi enyena o terisioroto oo lng'anayio loo nkiaasin enyena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oitodolua ilmonek o nenking'asia te nkop e Misiri, ometabaiki ena olong tiatua Israel o too loreren pooki, nintobiraki kewan enkarna, anaa enatiu ena olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyaua apa iyie iltung'ana linono Israel aitung'uaa enkop e Misiri too lmonek o too nenking'asia, te nkaina nagol naitoriori, o to lkirutoto sapuk; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nincho ninche ena kop, apa ninosie iyie olmumai tenebo loo menye pee incho ninche, enkop naruko inaishi o kule; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejing ninche atua neya aaitaa enenye. Kake eitu ninche ening oltoilo lino aashu epuo te nkitanapata ino; eitu ninche eas hoo toki te nena pooki apa nintanapa iyie ninche metaasa. Neaku nchoo iyie ena torroni pooki meeu shumata ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura enjore namanita amuat enkanasa pee eya, naa ore te nkaraki olalem o lameyu olmeitai eishooyioki enkanasa aapik nkaik oo Lkaldayo, laa ninche oarare ninye. Ore apa ina niroro iyie netabayie, naa ng'ura, idolita iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia Olaitoriani, kitiaaka nanu, Inyiang'u enkurma too mpisai ning'oru ilchakenini - hoo neishooyioki enkanasa aapik nkaik oo Lkaldayo. ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enetii Yeremia ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ura ara nanu Olaitoriani, Enkai e pooki naishu; keetae hoo toki nagol te nanu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.1+2CH.25.2+2CH.25.3+2CH.25.4+2CH.25.5+2CH.25.6+2CH.25.7+2CH.25.8+2CH.25.9+2CH.25.10+2CH.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 25.1-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku nji ejo Olaitoriani: Ng'ura kaishooyo nanu ena anasa apik nkaik oo Lkaldayo o atua nkaik e Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon; naa keya ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo Kaldayo oarare ena anasa naa kepuonu aapik ena anasa enkima, nepejoo ninye, tenebo nkajijik naa ore nchumat enye netapejokinyeki Baal enkorropil neibukorieki inaishi enkishoroto e nashe aabukoki kulie aitin, pee aaitagor nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore ilayiok le Israel o layiok le Yuda meeta ae nataasa neme entorroni too nkonyek aainei ebaiki kitisho enye; meeta ilayiok le Israel ae nataasa neme kaaitagoro nanu te siaai oo nkaik enye, Olaitoriani ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etuputuo ena anasa engoro ai o engoro ai napi ebaiki enkolong apa nateshetaki ometabaiki ena olong, neaku kaiwuang'ie nanu ninye too nkonyek aainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenkaraki entorroni pooki oo ilayiok le Israel o layiok le Yuda apa nataasa pee aaitagor ilaiguanak lenye o lkituaak lenye, ilapolosak lenye o loibonok lenye, iltung'ana le Yuda o lelo oomanyaYerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaibelekenyakita ninche nanu enkoriong enye, neitu aaitorioki inkomomi enye; naa ore hoo naiteng'ena nanu ninche aitirrishaki eitu ninche ening'isho aang'amu nkiteng'enat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.23.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 23.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.30+JER.7.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7.30-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.19.1+JER.19.2+JER.19.3+JER.19.4+JER.19.5+JER.19.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etipika ninche olminong atua ina aji naipotieki enkarna ai, pee eisarkionie ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.23.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 23.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etesheta ninche iwuejitin e shumata e Baal to yarata lo layioni le Hinom, pee etum aaitayunye ilayiok lenye o ntoyie olasar oishori Molek, hoo neitu nanu aitanap ninche, neitu ninye ejing aata e ndamunoto ai, nchere pee eas ena olminong napik Yuda ing'ok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkisiligata o siligi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji naa taata ejo Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel, tialo ena anasa nijojo intae, ‘Eishooyioki aapik atua enkaina o laiguanani le Babilon to lalem, o to lameyu, o to lmeitai’: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kaiturrur nanu ninche aitung'uaa nkuapi pooki apa naterewa ninche te ngoro ai o te ngoro ai napi te mpushuna kitok; kashuku nanu ninche meetu ene wueji, naisho nanu ninche metobiko te seriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keaku ninche iltung'ana laainei, naaku nanu Enkai enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaisho nanu ninche oltau obo o enkoitoi nabo pee aatum ninche aatureita nanu ntarasi tenkaraki ninche maate o nkera enye te siadi ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitobir nanu tenebo ninche osotua loo ntarasi, nchere maibelekenya nanu eitu aitaas ninche esidai; naa kapik nanu olturiaki lai atua oltau lenye, pee maaitoki ninche aaibelekenya aaing'uaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kang'ida nanu tenaitaas ninche esidai, naa kaun nanu ninche tiatua ena kop naitubulu to ltau lai pooki o te nkishui ai pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani: ore anaa enayaua nanu ena torroni kitok shumata kulo tung'ana, neijia sii aiko, kayau nanu shumata ninche ina pooki sidai apa naisiligie ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keinyiang'uni nkurman tena kop nijoitoto intae, olmuaate, metii oltung'ani aashu eng'ues; eishooyioki aapik atua nkaik oo Lkadayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keinyiang'uni nkurman too mpesai neigerokini mpala nkarn nemishiri neikeni, tiatua enkop e Benchamen, tiatua iwuejitin naamanita Yerusalem, o tiatua nkanas e Yuda, tiatua nkanas e nkop oo ldoinyo, tiatua nkanas e Shefela, o tiatua nkanas e Negeb; amu kashuku nanu ilooena lenye, Olaitoriani ojo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
